        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(slack): use endsWith instead of includes for _all_ action_id matching",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`isBulkActionsBlock()` used substring `includes(\"_all_\")` (then `endsWith(\"_all\")`) to detect bulk-action rows. Both heuristics are unsafe:\n\n1. **False positives**: IDs like `deploy_all_services` / `archive_all` can match suffix rules and lose their blocks during confirmation updates.\n2. **No producer contract**: bare `select_all` / `deselect_all` IDs were never emitted anywhere in OpenClaw — only synthetic tests referenced them.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Add OpenClaw-owned bulk contract in `extensions/slack/src/bulk-action-ids.ts`:\n  - `block_id` prefix: `openclaw:bulk:`\n  - closed action IDs: `openclaw:bulk:select_all`, `openclaw:bulk:deselect_all`\n  - producer helper: `buildOpenClawBulkActionsBlock()`\n- `interactions.block-actions.ts`: classify bulk rows via `isOpenClawBulkActionsBlock()` (marker + closed IDs), not global suffix heuristics.\n- Export contract helpers from `extensions/slack/api.ts` for producers.\n- Add grammar + whole-path handler regressions; tests use the shared producer helper.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Current head:** `7f3e2f2c`\n\n**Unit tests:**\n```\npnpm test extensions/slack/src/bulk-action-ids.test.ts\npnpm test extensions/slack/src/monitor/events/interactions.test.ts -t \"bulk|deploy_all_services\"\n→ 14 passed\n```\n\n**Closed action-ID grammar (`isOpenClawBulkActionId`):**\n\n| action_id | bulk? |\n|-----------|-------|\n| openclaw:bulk:select_all | yes |\n| openclaw:bulk:deselect_all | yes |\n| select_all | no |\n| deploy_all_services | no |\n| archive_all | no |\n\n**Live Slack proof (redacted, workspace channel `C0BGQ1REJ3T`):**\n\n1. **Bulk row removed when last individual control is selected**\n   - posted blocks: `divider → openclaw:bulk:actions → divider → approve_row`\n   - after Approve click (`chat.update`): `divider → context`\n   - `bulkRowRemoved: true`, `chatUpdateOk: true`\n   - message ts: `1783746112.698819`\n\n2. **`deploy_all_services` preserved when another individual row remains**\n   - posted blocks: `divider → openclaw:bulk:actions → divider → deploy_row → approve_row`\n   - after Approve click: bulk row **kept**, `deploy_all_services` row **kept**, approve row replaced by context confirmation\n   - message ts: `1783746090.752499`\n\n**Lint / typecheck:** oxlint on touched files — clean\n\n## Review\n\n- ClawSweeper P1 addressed: replaced global suffix with OpenClaw-owned block marker + closed IDs; added producer export; live Slack `chat.update` proof for both removal and preservation paths\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n",
        "branch": "fix/slack-bulk-actions-all-endsWith",
